           PERFORM 2000-SCREEN-OVD
           DISPLAY 'KYC: ' WS-KYC-DECISION
           STOP RUN.
       2000-SCREEN-OVD.
           IF ACCEPTED-OVD
              MOVE 'ACCEPT' TO WS-KYC-DECISION
           ELSE
              MOVE 'REJECT' TO WS-KYC-DECISION
